OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening for most although the odd spot
OL,7,Fof light rain lingering. A band of
OL,8,Forganised showers pushes in from the
OL,9,Fwest overnight, some of these heavy at
OL,10,Ftimes, mainly in the south. A cooler
OL,11,Fnight under easing winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FThe odd shower around to
OL,14,Fstart on Thursday before sunny spells
OL,15,Fdevelop through the day. Feeling
OL,16,Fpleasant with light winds, before
OL,17,FStorm Austen arrives through the
OL,18,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
