OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHeavy
OL,6,Frain on Friday with strong winds,
OL,7,Ffuelled by Storm Austen. Dry to start
OL,8,FSaturday, quickly turning very wet and
OL,9,Fwindy through the morning. Drier but
OL,10,Fbreezy on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
